<h2>(print: (passage:)'s title)</h2>
$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[

To say that the ''Grand Exchange'' building dominates Apesai's mid-island commercial district is an understatement.
<br>
Rather, it is more accurate to say that the entire district - warehouses, merchant residences, accounting and notary offices, commodity trading floors, and many alleyside markets - has grown out from the Grand Exchange, like moss gathering around a stone.
<br>
And what a stone it is. If not for the literal Opal atop the lighthouse, the Grand Exchange building, with its massive dome made from enough red steel to break a small kingdom's coffer - could be said to be Apesai's crown jewel.

]
